BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:NW3 -  Novice Nosework (Melinda Meche)
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20261005T230000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20261006T000000Z
DTSTAMP;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20261004T200355Z
UID:1791241200_NW3-NoviceNosework@luckydog
DESCRIPTION:In the Novice class of Nosework we add all of the oils into ou
 r cocktail so that your dog can start to discriminate between the differen
 t oils. We will start to build our search areas to mock Novice trial-like 
 settings. We will start to discuss rules and regulations of AKC\, UKC and 
 other organizations.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Manners 3 - Advanced (Lea Pfeiffer)
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20261005T230000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20261005T235500Z
DTSTAMP;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20261004T200355Z
UID:1791241200_Manners3-Advanced@luckydog
DESCRIPTION:Ready to take your dog’s training to the next level? In Adva
 nced Manners\, we build on your basic foundation to add distractions\, lea
 ve treats behind\, and introduce some tricks to keep it interesting! This 
 class is designed to take your dog’s behavior above and beyond to make s
 ure he can keep his brain in any situation. If you want to get into therap
 y work\, dog sports\, or just want your best friend to go out and about wi
 th you\, Advanced Manners is the place to be!
END:VEVENT
